{"file":"Agentics Beyond Code-0.5.1-v6.zip","bytes":579765,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"agentics-beyond-code","description":"Assess team workflows, design the right agentic workflows, and build them on GitHub, Claude, Productboard, Atlassian, or Google Workspace.","version":"0.5.1","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/chrizbo/agentics-beyond-code","homepage":"https://github.com/chrizbo/agentics-beyond-code"}],"skills":[{"path":".github/skills/agentic-workflow-planner/SKILL.md","name":"agentic-workflow-planner","description":"The platform-neutral front door to Agentics Beyond Code. Use it to assess how a team or organization works today and to design which agentic workflows, living documents, and human approval points it should adopt, before building on GitHub, Claude, Productboard, Atlassian, or Google Workspace. Trigger on assessment requests such as a pre-work or readiness assessment, current-state and gap analysis, org health readout, delivery or process diagnosis, bottleneck analysis, or a review of GitHub, Jira, Linear, project boards, incidents, discussions, and operating docs. Also trigger on design requests from non-coding operators (product managers, product ops, compliance, GTM, program owners, researchers, designers, support leads, team leads) such as \"what agentic workflows do I need\", \"turn my process into agentic workflows\", \"set up workflows for my team\", \"bootstrap Agentics Beyond Code\", \"steal from this repo for our team\", or \"where should these workflows run\".","headings":["Agentic Workflow Planner","Installed plugin context","Choose the mode","Assess","Design","Hand off to a builder","Output standard"],"name_hint":"agentic · 流程 · planner","description_zh":"作为 Agentics Beyond Code 的平台中立入口，评估团队现状、流程与瓶颈，设计应采用的代理工作流、持续维护文档和人工批准节点，再选择实现平台。"},{"path":".github/skills/atlassian-agent-builder/SKILL.md","name":"atlassian-agent-builder","description":"Build Atlassian Rovo agents and Jira or Confluence automation flows from Agentics Beyond Code workflows or a team's process. Use when asked to port a repository workflow to Jira, Confluence, or Rovo, create or update a Rovo agent, write Rovo agent instructions, or run agent work on a schedule, Jira event, workflow transition, or Confluence page event. Can create agents and automation flows through browser controls when authorized; deployment guidance is documentation-derived until field-tested. Drafting alone does not authorize deployment.","headings":["Atlassian Agent Builder","Choose the target and source","Installed package source access","Build the adaptation","Create in Rovo","Schedule and trigger the agent","Deliver the configuration","Examples of routing","Before you deliver"],"name_hint":"atlassian · 智能体 · builder","description_zh":"将团队流程或 Agentics Beyond Code 工作流转为 Atlassian Rovo 代理及 Jira/Confluence 自动化，支持定时和事件触发；创建或部署需相应授权，文档推导的建议需现场验证。"},{"path":".github/skills/claude-native-workflow-builder/SKILL.md","name":"claude-native-workflow-builder","description":"Use this skill when a user wants an always-on, org-owned automation built on Claude's own product surfaces — Claude Routines and Claude Scheduled Tasks — instead of GitHub Agentic Workflows, whether that means porting one or more of this repo's existing workflows or designing a new one from scratch, and whether or not GitHub is the team's system of record. Trigger on requests like \"set this up without GitHub\", \"build this as a Claude Routine\", \"schedule this with Claude\", \"I only want this one workflow, not the whole repo\", \"make this work in Slack/Notion/Jira instead of GitHub\", \"show me the same pattern but not GitHub-specific\", \"turn this process into a Routine or Scheduled Task\", or \"I don't want to learn gh-aw, what are my options\".","headings":["Claude-Native Workflow Builder","Installed plugin context","Core workflow","A. Porting an existing workflow","B. Designing a new automation","Both paths","Port fidelity and practical checks","Output standard","Important defaults"],"name_hint":"claude · native · 流程 · builder","description_zh":"在 Claude Routines 或 Scheduled Tasks 上构建组织拥有的持续自动化，移植既有工作流或从零设计，适用于希望使用 Claude 产品界面的团队。"},{"path":".github/skills/github-workflow-builder/SKILL.md","name":"github-workflow-builder","description":"Build an Agentics Beyond Code setup on GitHub: GitHub Agentic Workflows (gh-aw), repo folders, blank strategy and how-we-work docs, policies, issue templates, labels, and GitHub Projects boards. Use when a team whose work lives in GitHub Issues, Projects, or Discussions wants workflows set up or adapted from this repo, including requests like \"set this up on GitHub\", \"create the gh-aw workflows for my team\", \"scaffold the repo\", \"create strategy and how-we-work docs in our repo\", \"set up project boards and issue templates\", or \"copy these workflows into our repo\". For choosing which workflows to adopt or where they should run, use agentic-workflow-planner first.","headings":["GitHub Workflow Builder","Installed plugin context","Core workflow","Output standard","Important defaults"],"name_hint":"github · 流程 · builder","description_zh":"在 GitHub 上搭建 Agentics Beyond Code，包括 gh-aw 工作流、目录、战略与协作文件、政策、工单模板、标签和项目看板。"},{"path":".github/skills/google-workspace-agent-builder/SKILL.md","name":"google-workspace-agent-builder","description":"Build Google Workspace Studio flows, Studio skills, and related Google automations from Agentics Beyond Code workflows or a team's process. Use when asked to port a repository workflow to Google Workspace, Gmail, Drive, Docs, Sheets, or Chat, create a Workspace Studio flow or skill, run Gemini on a schedule or Workspace event, or decide which Google option (Studio, skills, Apps Script, Gemini Enterprise) fits the team's Workspace plan. Reasons about edition, add-ons, admin settings, and run quotas before recommending a surface. Can create flows and skills through browser controls when authorized; deployment guidance is documentation-derived until field-tested. Drafting alone does not authorize deployment.","headings":["Google Workspace Agent Builder","Choose the target and source","Installed package source access","Choose the Google surface for this plan","Build the adaptation","Create in Workspace Studio","Schedule and trigger the flow","Deliver the configuration","Examples of routing","Before you deliver"],"name_hint":"google · workspace · 智能体 · builder","description_zh":"将团队流程转为 Google Workspace Studio 流程、技能或相关自动化，先核对版本、附加许可、管理设置和额度，再选择实现方式；部署需授权并验证。"},{"path":".github/skills/productboard-agent-builder/SKILL.md","name":"productboard-agent-builder","description":"Build Productboard Spark agent instructions and reusable skills from Agentics Beyond Code workflows or a team's product process. Use when asked to port a repository workflow to Productboard, create a Spark skill, or turn product discovery, feedback, strategy, or planning practices into Productboard agent instructions, including scheduling and event-triggered execution. Can create or update skills through browser controls by default, with verified MCP/API operations when available and relevant. Drafting alone does not authorize deployment.","headings":["Productboard Agent Builder","Choose the target and source","Installed package source access","Build the adaptation","Create in Productboard","Schedule and trigger the skill","Deliver the instructions","Examples of routing"],"name_hint":"productboard · 智能体 · builder","description_zh":"将产品发现、反馈、战略或规划流程转为 Productboard Spark 代理指令与可复用技能，涵盖定时和事件触发；起草本身不代表获得部署授权。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["Agentics Beyond Code","Six skills","Try it","Installation and prerequisites","Data handling","Living documents","Your Habits Are Already Triggers","Updates and support"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/build-info.json",".claude-plugin/icon.png",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".github/skills/agentic-workflow-planner/SKILL.md",".github/skills/